  "description": "Gabrielo is a sans-serif blackletter typeface. Gabrielo has been released for those of you who are looking for a Sans-Serif Blackletter Typeface, The font is inspired by the Old English Font used in Western Europe Style with a few combined to turn them into a bit of a modern bold style font. It’s very suitable for logos, headlines, newspaper, book covers, certificates, comic beer labels, merchandise, packaging labels, badge/emblem logos, tattoo, and much more.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Gabrielo is a sans-serif blackletter typeface. Gabrielo has been released for those of you who are looking for a Sans-Serif Blackletter Typeface, The font is inspired by the Old English Font used in Western Europe Style with a few combined to turn them into a bit of a modern bold style font. It’s very suitable for logos, headlines, newspaper, book covers, certificates, comic beer labels, merchandise, packaging labels, badge/emblem logos, tattoo, and much more.</p>",
